Provenance of the initial code
------------------------------
The first commit of this repository (53b3c03, "import generic indicator,
strategy, factor and valuation modules from QuantRiskPro") copied 85 Python
files under src/quantrisk/{indicators,strategies,factor_research,valuation}
from the author's earlier private project TraderX (product name
"QuantRiskPro V2.0"), directory backend-python/src at revision 156d265e.
The TraderX repository carries an MIT License file with the notice
"Copyright (c) 2025 TraderX Team". Code in TraderX that was not written by
the author (two valuation calculators) and modules bound to its private
configuration and data sources were not imported.

File headers carried over from TraderX ("作者: TraderX Team",
"Copyright (c) 2025 TraderX. All rights reserved.",
"Copyright (c) 2025 QuantRiskPro. All rights reserved.") are kept unchanged
as a record of where the code came from. These files are distributed in this
repository under the MIT License above.

Everything added or changed after the initial import is listed by stage in
docs/PROVENANCE.md and can be traced in the git history.

Third-party software and data
-----------------------------
No third-party source code is bundled. Runtime dependencies (numpy, pandas,
scipy; optional statsmodels, scikit-learn, fastapi, uvicorn, akshare, TA-Lib)
are installed separately under their own licenses. Market data obtained
through akshare from public endpoints (Sina Finance, CNINFO) is not
redistributed; the data/ and reports/ directories are excluded from the
repository.
